  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "UK to adopt tougher stance on Israel with illegal settlements trade ban",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/07/ed-miliband-reset-uk-relations-israel-palestine",
      "description": "<p>Ed Miliband to reassert support for Palestinian rights and a two-state solution in move likely to draw fierce criticism from US and Israel</p><p>Ed Miliband will announce what he has described as a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/01/ed-miliband-promises-reset-of-uk-policy-toward-israel\">broad reset of the UK’s relations with Israel</a> on Tuesday, promising the government will take a more active approach in supporting the Palestinian cause.</p><p>In an intervention that is expected to draw fierce criticism from the US and Israel, the foreign secretary will impose a UK ban on the trade in goods and some services from illegal Israeli settlements.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/07/ed-miliband-reset-uk-relations-israel-palestine\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-07T18:34:37"
    },
    {
      "title": "UN expert Francesca Albanese calls for ‘true paradigm shift’ as Miliband resets policy on Israel",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/07/un-francesca-albanese-miliband-israel-palestine-settlements-trade",
      "description": "<p>Exclusive: UN special rapporteur on occupied territories says ban on goods from settlements ‘important’ but must go further if it is to amount to more than a ‘press release’</p><p>The UK’s planned ban on trade with unlawful Israeli settlements is a welcome, if overdue, first step and must be judged according to its practical impact, a UN expert has told the Guardian.</p><p>The UK foreign secretary, Ed Miliband, has vowed to act more decisively against Israeli settlements, as well as continued restrictions of aid into Gaza, prompting the US ambassador to Israel, Mike Huckabee, to claim on Saturday that Downing Street was motivated by “Jew hatred”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/07/un-francesca-albanese-miliband-israel-palestine-settlements-trade\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-07T04:00:25"
    },
    {
      "title": "Britain Set to Target Israeli West Bank Settlements With Trade Ban",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/middleeast/britain-sanctions-israeli-settlers.html",
      "description": "The expected move will be announced on Tuesday, officials said, and underscored Israel’s mounting isolation over its policies toward Palestinians following the war in Gaza.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-09-07T20:33:50"
